# AudioSeparator

Modular .NET audio stem separator. Packages: `AudioSeparator.Abstractions`, `.Core`, `.Onnx`, `.Onnx.Demucs`, `.FFMPEG`, `.NAudio`.

## Dependency direction

- Abstractions ← Core ← Onnx ← model-specific packages
- FFMPEG/NAudio → Abstractions only

## Core rules

- Separator **returns** `SeparationResult`; never use `IAudioWriter` in Core or Onnx
- Use `CreateSession` + `RunAsync`, not legacy `Separate()`
- Never read or edit paths in `.gitignore` / `.cursorignore`
- Do not scan the entire repo unless the user `@`-mentions a folder
- `@Older/` only when explicitly requested
